  "description": "Hollow Knight Minecraft Fully Playable Map",
  "body": "## **This is the full playable Hollow Knight Map Experience inside of Minecraft!**\nThis package includes a full non-offical playable recreation of Hollow Knight with the first 3 areas including.\n- Kings Pass\n- Dirtmouth\n- Forgotten Crossroads\n\nThis map has _3 Boss Fights_, as well as _16 types of enemies_ to find around the map!\nThere are also _4 shops_ and many charms you can find around as well!\n\n## Map Credits:\n- [Clouser](https://www.youtube.com/c/C1OUS3R): Coding/Building/Resources/Sfx\n- [NoteBlockMatt](https://www.youtube.com/@NoteBlockMatt): Music/Sfx\n- [MortimerKerman](https://mortimer-kerman.github.io/): Coding\n- [AshIsReal](https://twitter.com/Ash_is_real): Resources\n- [Zammyz](https://twitter.com/Zammyzammyzammy): Building\n\n_Hollow Knight is the copyright of Team Cherry. (teamcherry.com.au) (hollowknight.com) 'Hollow Knight' the name and logo are trademarks of Team Cherry._\n![Hollow Knight Minecraft Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4fcd1ad2a88dd35cf8b8a57d6e11810eebdc0698.png)",
